  "title": "Brandy Alexander Pie",
  "description": "This cognac- and creme de cacao-flavored pie is great for company. Make it ahead of time, so the filling has time to chill.",
  "authors": [
    "Linda K"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-05-14T10:19:08-04:00",
